// VARIANT ROTATION THIS ROUND, decided in .claude/brand-spec-prodeee168.md §3 and
// NOT re-picked here: the outgoing brand (รวยแท้168) is rotated out of every family
// at once — AnnouncementPremium replaces Announcement5, LatestWinnersCyber replaces
