// thumbs up, winking, beside the Thai word โปรดี168 in glossy 3-D cherry red with a
// white outline. The banner and both slides are a SUNLIT CARTOON FARM — a wooden
// windmill, a red barn, wooden fencing, blue sky with white cloud, a black-haired boy in
