// scattered carrots, white daisies and piles of gold coins around a wooden sign.
// ⚠️ The sky's blue, the field's green, the dungarees' indigo, the pig's pink and the
// fence's brown are OBJECTS IN THE PICTURE, not brand colours — none is allowed into the
// UI.
