// (R235 G3 B5), measured off logo.webp itself, which sits **40 units** from the outgoing
// รวยแท้168's crimson c30303 and only **18 units** from หวย365's dc0203 — closer than
// this repo normally tolerates, accepted deliberately because it is the logo's own
