// the second hue being **burnt copper #b44c06** (measured off banner1.png) instead of
// the outgoing round's antique gold, from the page being #ffd1d1 rather than ffdbdb,
// from the inset running warm cream #fff4ea rather than pink-tinted fff1ef, and from the
// full variant rotation.
// ⚠️ **Burnt copper #b44c06 CARRIES TEXT on a light card (5.3:1)** — that is the
// functional difference from the previous round's antique gold, which could not. ⚠️ But
